'''Baboon Brawlers''' are a monster encountered in the Path of Apmeken within the [[Tombs of Amascut]].

When attacking them with magic, they will take damage equal to the player's maximum hit. In addition, unlike most monsters, the Magic defence roll of Baboon Brawlers is calculated using their Defence level rather than their Magic level.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1689566945635438592|date=10 August 2023|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/107637|archivedate=10 August 2023|quote=[Are there any other monsters (especially bosses or in raids) which use Defence over Magic when calculating magical defence?] Fragment of Seren, Baboon Brawlers and that weird rabbit beyond Prifddinas, in addition to the ones already listed in this thread.}}

